---
// src/pages/the-babel-virus/index.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Hub II: The Babel Virus"
  description="Map the Archontic interference. Decode the Tower of Babel as an engineered software wipe designed to fracture the Mother-Tongue, instantiate binary phonetics, and weaponize the ambient acoustic grid."
>
  <div class="site-wrapper section theme-void" style="padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 80px;">

    <!-- Wayfinding Breadcrumb Conduit (Copper Theme) -->
    <nav class="anu-wayfinding-conduit" aria-label="Hub Navigation">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail trail-copper">
        <li><a href="/">↵ The Root Code</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page">Hub II: The Babel Virus</li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hub Hero Header (Copper Theme) -->
    <header class="anu-hub-hero anu-hub-hero-copper reveal">
      <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-copper">The Holy-Denying Force</span>
      <h1>The Babel Virus</h1>
      <p class="hero-description" style="color: var(--anu-parchment); font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem); max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8;">
        Map the Archontic interference. Decode the "Tower of Babel" not as a myth, but as an engineered software wipe designed to fracture the Mother-Tongue, instantiate binary phonetics, and weaponize the ambient acoustic grid.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Context / Callout Aside (The Linguistic Hijack) -->
    <section class="anu-container reveal reveal-delay-1 central-aside-wrapper">
      <aside class="anu-terminal anu-terminal-copper">
        <h2>The Linguistic Hijack</h2>
        <p>
          A prison built of iron can be broken by physical force. A prison built of language requires the inmate to use the warden's own keys to think about escaping. This is the absolute genius of the Demiurgic architecture.
        </p>
        <p class="spacing-bottom-none">
          By stripping the human Bio-Computer of the scalar-rendering Anuhazi Root Code, the Archons forced humanity into a low-frequency, binary operating system. Modern language does not describe reality; it actively limits the biological hardware's ability to process anything beyond physical density and emotional friction.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <!-- Node Grid (Copper Cards) -->
    <div class="anu-container anu-grid reveal reveal-delay-2 grid-spacing-bottom">
      
      <!-- Node 2.1 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-copper">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-copper">Node 2.1</span>
        <h3 class="node-title">The Software Wipe</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Decode the historical "Tower of Babel" as an engineered cybernetic event. Analyze the deliberate fragmentation of the Anuhazi root code into disconnected tribal dialects designed to prevent planetary synchronization.
        </p>
        <a href="/the-babel-virus/the-software-wipe/" class="anu-card-link">Compile Data &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Node 2.2 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-copper">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-copper">Node 2.2</span>
        <h3 class="node-title">Binary Phonetics</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Examine the conflict matrix. How modern terrestrial languages are structurally coded for duality, opposition, and separation, actively generating the thermodynamic loosh harvested by the Archons.
        </p>
        <a href="/the-babel-virus/binary-phonetics/" class="anu-card-link">Compile Data &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Node 2.3 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-copper">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-copper">Node 2.3</span>
        <h3 class="node-title">Ambient Weaponization</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Diagnose the local environment. Analyze modern media, commercial music, and political rhetoric as localized static designed to keep the human nervous system locked in fight-or-flight processing.
        </p>
        <a href="/the-babel-virus/ambient-weaponization/" class="anu-card-link">Compile Data &rarr;</a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- Divider (Bounded) -->
    <div class="anu-container reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <hr class="anu-divider divider-copper central-divider" />
    </div>

    <!-- Hub Transit Link (Reconciling Force) -->
    <nav class="anu-container reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <div class="anu-hub-transition">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">The Holy-Reconciling Force Awaits</span>
        <a href="/wave-genetics/" class="anu-btn anu-btn-ghost">
          Engage Hub III: Wave Genetics &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Baseline alignment for card titles across 2-line and 3-line wraps */
  .node-title {
    min-height: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  /* Grid spacing cushion */
  .grid-spacing-bottom {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  /* Terminal inner paragraph reset */
  .spacing-bottom-none {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Bottom transit bar flex alignment */
  .anu-hub-transition {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  .anu-hub-transition .anu-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Responsive stacking for smaller screens */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .node-title {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .anu-hub-transition {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .anu-hub-transition .anu-btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
